OL,3,GNEWSAFive groups share #450,000 to
OL,4,Asupport young people
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive organisations will share #450,000
OL,7,Fin funding to support young people and
OL,8,Fprevent serious violence.
OL,10,FThe Northamptonshire Serious Violence
OL,11,FPrevention Partnership has awarded the
OL,12,Fmoney to groups delivering programmes
OL,13,Facross the county that focus on early
OL,14,Fintervention and prevention.
OL,16,FThe money will fund activities to help
OL,17,Fyoung people build skills and
OL,18,Fconfidence, stay safe and avoid being
OL,19,Fexploited or harmed.
